    <string name="settings_licenses">Open-source licenses</string>
    <string name="settings_licenses_body">This app uses open-source software:\n\n• AndroidX / Jetpack Compose — Apache-2.0\n• Media3 (ExoPlayer) — Apache-2.0\n• Google Cast SDK — Google Cast SDK Terms\n• Hilt — Apache-2.0\n• Room — Apache-2.0\n• OkHttp — Apache-2.0\n• Coil — Apache-2.0\n• kotlinx.coroutines / kotlinx.serialization — Apache-2.0\n• NanoHTTPD — BSD-3-Clause\n• FFmpegKit (https) — LGPL-3.0 / Apache-2.0\n• kxml2 — MIT</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy">Privacy policy</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy_body">This app is a player only: it does not include, host or distribute channels or content.\n\nYour data stays on your device. Playlists, login credentials, favorites and history are stored locally on your phone and are never sent to our servers or third parties.\n\nAccount passwords are stored encrypted with the Android Keystore (AES-GCM) and never appear in logs.\n\nThe app only connects to your IPTV provider\'s servers to download your playlist, the program guide and play the content you configured.\n\nThere are no ads, no trackers and no third-party analytics.\n\nYou can delete all your data at any time from System Settings → Apps → Clear data.</string>
